# The Docker build (deploy/docker/Dockerfile) installs and builds from
# source inside the image, so nothing built or installed on the host belongs
# in the context — a host's node_modules holds native binaries for the wrong
# platform, and a stale dist/ would be packed as if it were this commit.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.claude
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
**/*.tgz
# Secrets an operator keeps next to the compose file. The image never needs
# them; they reach the container through env_file at run time.
deploy/docker/stratusd.env
**/*.env
!deploy/docker/stratusd.env.example
